==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Noble Victories|Cryogonal|32}} from the {{TCG|Noble Victories}} expansion.
*'''Ice Blade''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Diamond & Pearl|Empoleon|4}} from the {{TCG|Diamond & Pearl}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

